      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2010 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Melorheostosis is an uncommon and rare linear hyperostosis, which can be complicated by soft tissue changes. We present a case of this disorder in the humerus, clinically referred because of carpal tunnel syndrome. Although treatment is usually conservative, in this case, a neurolysis and resection of the sclerotic bone were done with good clinical result."
      },
